OL,3,GNEWSASkye road to remain closed with
OL,4,A40-mile diversion after landslip
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road on the Isle of Skye will remain
OL,7,Fclosed until further notice after it
OL,8,Fwas blocked by a landslip on Friday.
OL,10,FThe ground fell away from the side of
OL,11,Fthe A855 north of Uig onto a local
OL,12,Faccess road, but there were no
OL,13,Finjuries.
OL,15,FThe A855 road encircles the Trotternish
OL,16,Fpeninsula in the north of the island,
OL,17,Fand a diversion via the A87 and A855
OL,18,FStaffin Road is in place.
OL,20,FHighland Council says remedial work is
OL,21,Funderway with road teams working to
OL,22,Fclear the debris.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
